    "title": "Spades Solitaire - Card Games",
    "description": "Bring you the classic spades game, relax every cell of the body, exercise the smart brain.\r\n\r\nWithout network, you can start the game anytime and anywhere, necessary information display, simple graphical interface, smooth card playing experience and high-freedom game rule configuration. All your needs.\r\n\r\n\u2660Featuring:\r\n\uf0b2\tTwo types: Standard and New York City rules.\r\n\uf0b2\tThree games: Solo, Partner and Competition.\r\n\uf0b2\tTwo difficulty levels: Junior AI or Senior AI.\r\n\uf0b2\tSix different rule configurations.\r\n\uf0b2\tSixteen cute animal heads to choose from.\r\n\uf0b2\tSix different levels of tournament honor badges.\r\n\uf0b2\tThirty-eight achievements.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions about the game, please let us know by email and we will evaluate and update the game as soon as possible.",
